					{ "key": "requiresApproval", "label": "Requires approval", "type": "boolean" },
					{ "key": "approvalStatus", "label": "Approval status", "type": "string" },
					{ "key": "lifecycleState", "label": "Lifecycle state", "type": "string" },
					{ "key": "lastCompliantDate", "label": "Last compliant", "type": "string" }
				],
				"_note": "MASTER — a treasury (schatkistbankieren) bank account. Body pairs the account identity (IBAN/BIC/bank) with the compliance state: classification, master-list status, approval workflow and last-compliant date. Its compliance reports are the primary related content on the body; the audit trail sits in the sidebar. A treasury master record does not correspond — no comms leaves.",
